{"cwd": "/home/user/rainbow-", "entrypoint": "remote_mobile", "gitBranch": "ccr-61131b9d-uj0oqb", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"content": [{"content": [{"text": "{\"number\":11,\"title\":\"Screen 05 tunnel: near gold frame, Blender paddles, game-vs-approved region metrics\",\"body\":\"This continues the interrupted Screen 05 tunnel colour task from `e27c6fa` (`ccr-57af22a4-lsg7y7`). **Experiment only. Do not merge or promote it until the visual result is approved.**\\n\\n## What changed\\n- **`tools/proj05/screen_regions.py`** compares a real game capture with the APPROVED picture, region by region (WALL, RING, LID, NEARFRAME, WATER, BENNY, COINS, TUNNEL, FRAME, FULL). The HUD is reported separately and excluded from every tunnel region.\\n- **`?projframe05=1`** gives the near gold frame (bottom corners and bottom lip) the approved gold band (`tools/proj05/frame_bake.py` → `assets/textures/tunnel05/frame05.png`).\\n  - The switch also includes an outline fix: perspective had pushed the frame 15–35 px outward.\\n  - One bloom-feedback pass is applied.\\n- **`?projlid05=1`** replaces the six wall paddles (L1 L2 L3 / R1 R2 R3) with Blender-built 3D trays that face down like the approved picture.\\n  - Pipeline: `tools/proj05/lid_mesh2d.py` → `scripts/proj05-lid-raycast.mjs` (approved outlines lifted onto the real wall through the locked camera) → Blender `tools/proj05/lid_blender.py` → `assets/models/lids05.glb` and `qa/pilot05/proj/tunnel/lid/lids05.blend`.\\n  - Under the switch, the default slab pucks and the far pucks are hidden.\\n- **`scripts/proj05-move.mjs`** captures real motion frames ridden forward from the checkpoint.\\n- **Evidence:** `qa/pilot05/proj/tunnel/NOTES.md`, plus approved / before / new captures, region metrics and gameplay results in `qa/pilot05/proj/tunnel/frame/` and `qa/pilot05/proj/tunnel/lid/`.\\n\\n## Measured vs approved (mean |dRGB|, share within 20 levels)\\n| Region | Recovered `e27c6fa` | + `projframe05` | + `projlid05` |\\n|---